yayinda sauran mutane daga Yahuda da Benyamin suka zauna a Urushalima).

    Daga zuriyar Yahuda akwai,
    Atahiya ɗan Uzziya, ɗan Zakariya, ɗan Amariya, ɗan Shefatiya, ɗan Mahalalel, wani zuriyar Ferez;

Sai kuma Mattaniya ɗan Mika, ɗan Zabdi, ɗan Asaf, shugaban da yake bi da hidimar godiya da kuma addu’a.
    Sai Bakbukiya, na biyu a cikin ’yan’uwansa;
    da Abda ɗan Shammuwa, ɗan Galal, ɗan Yedutun.

A kwanakin Yohiyakim, waɗannan su ne shugabannin iyalan firistoci,

    na iyalin Serahiya, Merahiya;
    na iyalin Irmiya, Hananiya;
